<section class="info-section">
  <h2>What Is Inertia X UI?</h2>
  <p>Inertia X UI is a Svelte component library for Inertia X. It packages opinionated, reusable UI primitives that feel native to browser navigation, including modal flows that can push, replace, and restore history cleanly.</p>

  <p class="stack-diagram">
    <span>Inertia X UI</span>
    <span class="stack-arrow">UI primitives like Modal, plus ready-to-use themes</span>
  </p>
  <p class="stack-diagram">
    <span>Inertia X</span>
    <span class="stack-arrow">Frame-based routing, history-aware mounts, and global link interception</span>
  </p>
  <p class="stack-diagram">
    <span>Inertia.js</span>
    <span class="stack-arrow">Server-driven SPA model</span>
  </p>
</section>

<section class="component-index">
  <h2>Components</h2>
  <p class="section-intro">Start with a UI component from Inertia X UI, then learn the underlying Inertia X primitive.</p>
  <div class="component-grid">
    <a href="/modal.json" class="component-card">
      <h3>Modal</h3>
      <p><strong>Package:</strong> inertiax-ui</p>
      <p>Open history-aware Inertia pages in an overlay.</p>

```svelte
<script>
